atlas interactions
# Cross-architecture contracts. Often more important than architecture interiors:
# the hardest bugs live in the bridges. Each names what it preserves, what it
# drops, and what it must NOT promote.

interaction feldera-maintains-reachability
  source feldera
  destination proof-frontier
  relation incremental_maintenance
  preserves the proven-layer set and its retractions
  drops the need to recompute the whole answer on a change
  forbidden_inference an organism route withdrawn -> its independent members retracted
  invalidates_on a proof fact is inserted or retracted (reheat)
  witness reachability-proof.json (organism 1,2,3,2; fpq_present 1,1,1,1)
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_reachability_incremental.rs

interaction verus-verifies-frontier-invariant
  source verus
  destination proof-frontier
  relation formal_verification
  preserves the exact invariant stated
  drops invariants not stated to the verifier
  forbidden_inference one invariant proven -> the layer or system is correct
  witness a bounded proof artifact
  binding architecture/substrate/foundry.yaff

interaction restate-durably-runs-work
  source restate
  destination work-graph
  relation durable_execution
  preserves the work item identity across long waits
  drops the meaning of the work (Restate owns durability, not semantics)
  forbidden_inference durably waiting -> the external event will occur
  witness a journaled durable handle
  binding architecture/substrate/foundry.yaff

interaction hvm4-reduces-fpq-seed
  source hvm4
  destination fpq-seed
  relation bounded_reduction
  preserves the seed program structure
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference a reduction completes -> the seed reconstructs the tensor
  witness a bounded reduction result
  binding architecture/substrate/foundry.yaff

interaction address-plane-feeds-closure
  source address-plane
  destination capability-closure
  relation eligibility_prefilter
  preserves the surviving eligible command families
  drops candidates rejected by capability, authority, or proof masks
  forbidden_inference a survivor -> a runnable or authorized binding (it is only eligible)
  witness RouteResult
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/address_plane.py

interaction authority-compiles-to-mask
  source authority-graph
  destination address-plane
  relation mask_compilation
  preserves the current permission cut for an actor over a subject
  drops revoked and expired grants
  forbidden_inference a mask bit set -> authority to act (the mask is a compiled cut, not the grant)
  invalidates_on a grant is revoked or expires
  witness authority_have_mask
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/address_plane.py

interaction frontier-compiles-to-ternary
  source proof-frontier
  destination address-plane
  relation ternary_compilation
  preserves proven layers as +1 and KnownNonCauses as -1 blackholes
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference a -1 blackhole -> a permanent truth (a reheat signal reopens it)
  invalidates_on a reheat signal satisfies a cooled invariant
  witness proof_ternary
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/address_plane.py

interaction capability-compiles-to-mask
  source capability-lattice
  destination address-plane
  relation mask_compilation
  preserves the estate's real capability families as bit positions
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference a capability mask match -> a runnable binding
  witness capability_mask
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/address_plane.py

interaction closure-gated-by-frontier
  source capability-closure
  destination proof-frontier
  relation mutation_gate
  preserves target layer identity
  preserves observed failure
  drops unrelated composition state
  forbidden_inference a high-layer symptom -> authorization to touch a proven low layer
  authority the fence decision is binding, not advisory
  invalidates_on a named reheat signal satisfies a cooled invariant
  witness FenceDecision
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/capability_closure.py

interaction lattice-feeds-discipl
  source capability-lattice
  destination discipl-composition
  relation binding_source
  preserves family identity
  preserves estate and law
  drops maturity claims of unrelated commands
  forbidden_inference classified estate -> single-estate binding
  witness command binding source_ref
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/capability_closure.py

interaction discipl-composes-into-closure
  source discipl-composition
  destination capability-closure
  relation composition
  preserves per-hop confidence and semantic loss
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference proposed chain -> runnable chain
  witness ExecutionOrganism
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/capability_closure.py

interaction serm-reduces-to-sufficiency
  source serm
  destination proof-frontier
  relation sufficiency_consequence
  preserves the covered layers and their witnesses
  drops measurements with no witness (they fail the honesty audit)
  forbidden_inference a required layer named -> a required layer proven
  invalidates_on a covered layer is reheated
  witness serm.sufficiency invariant
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/serm.py

interaction fpq-run-feeds-frontier
  source fpq-transform
  destination proof-frontier
  relation execution_is_evidence
  preserves fixture identity (gguf sha256)
  preserves report digest
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference reconstruction within tolerance -> semantic behaviour proven
  authority a real run may only cool the reconstruction layer, never semantic_behavior
  invalidates_on fixture mse exceeds ceiling
  invalidates_on fixture gguf hash changes
  witness fpq.reconstruction.fixture.tiny_f16
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/fpq_evidence.py

interaction representation-feeds-sli
  source fpq-transform
  destination sli-execution
  relation representation_to_execution
  preserves model representation identity
  drops reconstruction-layer proof
  forbidden_inference reconstruction proven -> SLI execution proven
  witness SLIExecutionWitness
  binding packs/fpq-proof-frontier/work.yaff

interaction actor-autofills-form
  source actor-graph
  destination atomic-form
  relation verified_autofill
  preserves actor identity for the named profile
  drops asserted-only identity
  forbidden_inference asserted-via-email actor -> autofilled verified field
  authority only a verified_for(profile) actor may fill a field
  invalidates_on the actor's identifier profile changes
  witness Field.autofill_actor
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/atomic_forms.py

interaction formgraph-compiles-to-atomicform
  source form-graph
  destination atomic-form
  relation compile
  preserves field structure, evidence matchers, authority requirements
  drops conditional fields whose condition does not hold for this submission
  forbidden_inference a field in the graph -> a required field in the compiled form
  witness compile(FormGraph, values)
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/form_graph.py

interaction binding-fills-form-evidence
  source evidence-binding
  destination atomic-form
  relation evidence_fill
  preserves the requirement -> candidate match and its witness
  drops candidates that fail the semantic test
  forbidden_inference an artifact in a slot -> the requirement satisfied
  forbidden_inference positional order -> a valid binding
  invalidates_on the bound artifact's digest changes
  witness EvidenceBinding.witness
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/institution_loop.py

interaction twin-materializes-into-evidence
  source foreign-twin
  destination atomic-form
  relation evidence_materialization
  preserves content-addressed artifact identity
  drops remote authority
  forbidden_inference cached projection -> remote truth
  authority materialize requires at least the reference right
  invalidates_on the foreign projection changes
  witness EvidenceSlot.artifact_digest
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/foreign.py

interaction closure-submits-work
  source capability-closure
  destination work-graph
  relation durable_submission
  preserves organism goal and per-hop binding
  drops non-durable form routing
  forbidden_inference blocked organism -> submitted work
  witness native mission id
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/capability_closure.py

interaction transport-carries-hop
  source transport-phenotype
  destination capability-closure
  relation carrier
  preserves the hop's computed digest
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference MCP receipt -> a different computation ran
  witness signed receipt
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/transport.py

interaction service-backs-work
  source service-lifecycle
  destination work-graph
  relation service_binding
  preserves service instance identity
  drops released instances
  forbidden_inference service active -> bind authority
  invalidates_on the service lease goes stale
  witness ProvisionBinding
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/service_lifecycle.py

interaction unlock-activates-resource
  source unlock-graph
  destination resource-activation
  relation capacity_unlock
  preserves the unlock condition
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference an unlock exists -> the resource is free or authorized
  witness ActivationMechanism

interaction verification-resolves-identity-blocker
  source actor-graph
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves verified_for(profile)
  drops asserted-only identity
  forbidden_inference asserted actor -> resolved identity blocker
  invalidates_on the actor's confidence drops below verified
  witness actor_nodes.confidence
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction proof-resolves-layer-blocker
  source proof-frontier
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves the proven layer identity
  drops non-proven layers
  forbidden_inference an open layer -> a resolved proof_layer blocker
  invalidates_on the frontier layer is reheated
  witness frontier_layers.status
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction work-resolves-dependency-blocker
  source work-graph
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves the satisfied work item identity
  drops unsatisfied or failed items
  forbidden_inference an open work item -> a resolved work_done blocker
  witness work_items.state
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction authority-gates-activation
  source authority-graph
  destination resource-activation
  relation activation_gate
  preserves the activate grant over the resource
  drops eligibility that lacks authority
  forbidden_inference resource eligible -> resource activated
  invalidates_on the activate grant is revoked or expires
  witness has_authority(ACTIVATE)
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/resource_activation.py

interaction service-binding-activates-resource
  source service-lifecycle
  destination resource-activation
  relation mechanism_binding
  preserves the bound service instance identity
  drops unbound or released instances
  forbidden_inference service provisioned -> resource activated
  invalidates_on the service is released
  witness bound_services
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/resource_activation.py

interaction activation-resolves-resource-blocker
  source resource-activation
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves the activated resource identity
  drops resources short of activated
  forbidden_inference a candidate resource -> a resolved resource_active blocker
  witness is_activated
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction relationship-resolves-stage-blocker
  source relationship-graph
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves the relationship stage and its evidence, per profile
  drops relationships under other profiles
  forbidden_inference collaboration on one profile -> a resolved stage blocker on another
  invalidates_on the relationship is corrected below the required stage
  witness stage_at_least
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction shadow-converts-via-relationship
  source relationship-graph
  destination shadow-institution
  relation conversion_gate
  preserves the contact and profile the relationship advanced under
  drops observation detail that no relationship backs
  forbidden_inference public structure mapped -> shadow institution active
  invalidates_on the relationship is corrected below engaged
  witness conversion_stage
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/shadow_institution.py

interaction relationship-earns-verification
  source relationship-graph
  destination actor-graph
  relation verification_basis
  preserves the profile the relationship advanced under
  drops asserted-only identity
  forbidden_inference relationship engaged -> actor automatically verified (verification is a deliberate act)
  witness relationship trajectory
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/relationship.py

interaction authority-resolves-authority-blocker
  source authority-graph
  destination unlock-graph
  relation blocker_resolution
  preserves the granting edge (actor, permission, subject, purpose)
  drops expired and revoked edges
  forbidden_inference an unlock exists -> authority to take it
  invalidates_on the granting edge expires or is revoked
  witness has_authority
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/opportunity.py

interaction reachability-gates-form-pipeline
  source unlock-graph
  destination atomic-form
  relation reachability_gate
  preserves the opportunity's reachable_now status
  drops blocked and merely-unlockable opportunities
  forbidden_inference all blockers resolved -> submit the form (loop stops at a draft)
  authority only a reachable_now opportunity may drive the submit-ready loop
  invalidates_on any blocker reopens
  witness OpportunityLoopResult
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/institution_loop.py

interaction service-bind-is-an-unlock
  source unlock-graph
  destination service-lifecycle
  relation activation_mechanism
  preserves the service_bound blocker subject
  drops nothing
  forbidden_inference service catalogued -> service_bound blocker resolved
  authority binding a service requires the bind right
  witness ServiceProfile.state
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/service_lifecycle.py

interaction address-plane-ranks-survivors
  source address-plane
  destination route-ranker
  relation learned_ranking
  preserves the eligible survivor set (only its order changes)
  drops nothing (ranking never removes an eligible candidate)
  forbidden_inference a top rank -> a correct, authorized, or runnable route (the fence and closure still run)
  witness rank_commands
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/route_ranker.py

interaction proof-frontier-reheats-feldera
  source proof-frontier
  destination feldera
  relation change_notification
  preserves the identity of the proof facts that changed (inserted or retracted)
  drops the conclusions that did not change -- only the delta reheats
  forbidden_inference a reheat occurred -> the maintained answer changed (a reheat may reconfirm the same set)
  invalidates_on the maintained relation is read while a proof fact write is in flight
  witness reachability-proof.json (the retraction that withdrew organism 2 and reheated the fold)
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_reachability_incremental.rs

interaction partner-commons-projects-foreign-twin
  source partner-commons
  destination foreign-twin
  relation rights_limited_projection
  preserves partner identity, source institution, and observe/reference rights
  drops remote mutation rights and any claim that cached state is current remote truth
  forbidden_inference a partner observation -> bind or act authority
  witness partner_state_is_a_rights_limited_foreign_twin
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/partner_commons.py

interaction blogger-receipt-feeds-evidence
  source blogger-publication-surface
  destination evidence-graph
  relation receipt_projection
  preserves external post identity, public URL, publication time, source lineage, and API acknowledgement
  drops OAuth credentials, access tokens, refresh tokens, and unneeded Blogger response fields
  forbidden_inference an API acknowledgement -> the article's substantive claims are true
  invalidates_on the public URL becomes unavailable or the receipt no longer matches the external post identity
  evidence the safe Blogger API response supports only api-acknowledged and publicly-addressable publication claims
  witness test_safe_blogger_receipt_projects_once_into_occurrence_and_evidence
  binding components/BonfyreControlPlane/blogger_receipts.py
